WEBVTT

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.070
Let's go!

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.780
Come on! Give 'em an uppercut!

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.370
Uppercut, I said!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.040
Go! Do an uppercut already!

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:42.200
Go for it! Joe! Joe! Hurry!

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.560
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:42.200
<i>Come on, Joe! You can beat him!</i>

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.610
Go for it!

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:43.610
<i>Beat him!</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:44.170
Come on!

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:49.000
Pull an elbow drop! An octopus hold! You can win!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.880
Joe! Uppercut! Do an uppercut!

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.880
Yeah! Go! Go for it!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.060
Come on, fight!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.890
Come you can do it! You can still win!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>Yeah, Nishi! You're getting him!</i>

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.350
Don't you lose!

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.890
All I own is riding on you! Come on!

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.270
Hey, what the hell are you doing? That's cheating!

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.110
Oh, look! They're getting away!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.940
<i>Hey, that's a cheap shot!</i>

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:11.940
Pin him down!

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.990
Oh, no! They're coming right for me!

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.700
All right, that's the match. The rhinoceros beetle wins.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.490
You mean Joe?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:21.450
Don't get so excited. Nishi won!

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.620
Are you trying to say that Joe lost?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.000
That's not fair!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.460
Well, life isn't fair, kid!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.710
All right, Kinoko. You better hand over that squid.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.250
You're so greedy!

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.000
If this was the real Joe, he'd be one of those sideshow boxers.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.260
Liar!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.760
Now on to the next match!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.770
That's not true!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.430
Now Nishi's gonna challenge Danpei!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.730
Awesome! Kenkichi sure slimmed down!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.450
All right, I bet on him!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.440
<i>I bet on Nishi again!</i>

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.240
What about you, Sachi?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.120
Any game where Joe loses is stupid!

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.830
Okay, have it your way!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.450
And we're all ready! Fight!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.020
Go for it, Danpei!

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.820
Yes! Get him right there! There you go!

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.960
Yeah! Way to go, Danpei!

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:09.960
<i>Fine!</i>

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.670
Hmph!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.790
What's wrong with you! Get a move on!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.800
Joe would never lose a match!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:25.700
Oh, come on!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.660
It's Joe!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.780
Joe!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.790
Joe!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.560
What are you doing running out in the middle of the road?!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.430
Sachi?

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.990
Is that you, Sachi? What's wrong?

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.730
Joe... Joe was...

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.070
You mean Yabuki-kun?

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.020
Where is he?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.870
Nobody's here.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.710
Oh, Sachi...

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.500
You should come with me. I'm making a delivery to that corner.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.920
I'll give you a ride back.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.250
Okay.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:49.810
Look over there!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:53.350
That's the perfect sucker to get some pachinko money from!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.400
You guys ready?

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.400
Let's do this.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.120
This is gonna be sweet.

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.670
H-Hey, why'd you stop?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.590
Oh?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.630
What?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.640
H-Hey, isn't that's Joe!?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.140
It's Bro Joe!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.140
Joe!

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.690
Bro Joe! Bro Joe!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.810
Bro Joe!

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:39.840
Yeah! Bro Joe!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.160
Welcome back!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.160
You really came back, Bro Joe!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.120
You guys should've come sooner.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.330
Welcome back, Boss!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.330
Glad you've returned from your long journey!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.130
We've protected your turf in your absence!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.640
Still, your faces are as filthy as ever.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.070
Come on, isn't that going too far?

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.780
With your filthy faces...

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.990
And the nice smell of this drainage ditch...

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:27.150
it makes me feel like I've really come home.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.660
What are you talking about?

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.120
And why does the great Bro Joe have such a horrid-looking face?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.210
Oh, this thing?

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:39.120
I actually had a little fight yesterday as a welcoming gift.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:43.550
Wow! Does that mean you're going back to boxing?

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.220
Yeah.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.680
That's awesome!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.550
What do you say, Danpei-san?

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:52.140
Namida Bridge just isn't complete without Joe!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.020
And now that Joe's back in Namida Bridge,

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.820
all we gotta do is rebuild Tange Boxing Gym!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.590
So this is the fortress of my comeback.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:29.670
And what a poor and glum fortress it is.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.230
Oh, yeah! Nishi's not here! Where is he?

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.190
Oh, yeah! We gotta go tell Mammoth!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.190
<i>We're gonna go find him!</i>

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:57.700
Nishi-kun!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.380
I bought us some ice cream!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.710
Let's eat it before it melts!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.210
Okay, thanks.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.130
It's so hot I could go for a cold shower.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.710
Hey! Mammoth Nishi!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.010
Guess what? Bro Joe's back!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.010
<i>Bro Joe's back!</i>

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.010
What? Joe's back?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.180
Yabuki-kun?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:18.940
He's back?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:22.110
Yeah! And he's gonna rebuild the gym!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.190
Come on, Nishi-kun! Let's go!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.990
Nishi-kun, what's gotten into you?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.450
Nothing.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.700
Besides, I'm too busy to go right now.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.700
You go on without me.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.040
What's the matter?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.040
Aren't you his only friend?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:45.170
I'll explain everything to my father later, so let's just go!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.170
No, I'm...

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.430
Nishi-kun, this is for the one and only Yabuki-kun!

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:53.170
You should come!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.520
I said no, and that means no!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:09:00.060
What the hell? We were even nice enough to tell you!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.180
Nishi hates Joe now!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.860
Nishi's a traitor!

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:05.880
Let's go, Nori-chan.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:06.610
Okay.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.200
Forget Nishi! Let's just go!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.950
Nishi, you traitor!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.240
Nishi-kun, I know you want to see Yabuki-kun again.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.000
I would've thought you'd be the first to go see him!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.050
But you're...

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.800
Noriko-han, I'd rather you didn't ask me why.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.760
Man, what the hell's gotten into Nishi?

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.060
I know, right?

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.600
Awesome! Look at them go!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.110
Hey!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.410
Bro Joe! Nishi said he's not coming!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.370
I see. Mind pulling on that rope?

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.610
Okay, got it!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.120
Pull!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.600
Heave!

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.130
Well, what do you think of my gym?

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.640
That looks just about right.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:20.270
Wow! Let me write something, too!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.470
No, not happening.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.680
You're mean!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.140
Then write my name on it!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.640
Write my name, too!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.860
Oh, don't be ridiculous!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.820
Are you that confident in your own handwriting?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:32.150
Hey, don't touch me!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.650
I'll teach you calligraphy!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.780
Now you're making fun of me, you son of a bitch!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.530
Get back here!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:47.670
Yowch!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.550
So it's you, Sachi!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.510
Wow! Welcome back, Joe!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.390
Where've you been hiding, Sachi?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.560
I knew somebody was missing, and I guess it was you!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.060
You didn't forget about me, did you?

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.820
Of course not, Sachi.

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.570
I came back just so I could see your grimy face!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.610
Hey, hey, hold it, bro!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.450
You better stop macking it up so soon after getting back!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.570
Shut up!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.080
We're having a touching reunion!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.580
Don't spoil the mood!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.620
What, you think we're in a movie or something?

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:32.580
Hey! I'm done with the sign!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.720
Hooray!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.500
Wow, awesome!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.300
It's really something!

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:04.450
Joe, this is your gym now.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.710
This is where you'll start out again!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.730
So this is the fortress of my comeback.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.100
It's real swell, old man.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.320
Heave-ho...

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.330
I brought some water!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.580
Come to think of it, Mammoth never showed up last night, did he?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.090
Does Nishi really hate Joe now?

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.380
Well, I really hate Mammoth now!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.800
That damn traitor! Next time I see him, I'm gonna take this mop,

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.090
and do this to him!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.100
Hey, that was uncalled for!

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.600
Sorry, but Mammoth's attitude just gets on my nerves!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:21.820
Nishi-kun! Dinner's ready!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.610
Nishi-kun!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:46.550
Hey! Nishi! Dinner's ready!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.890
Dinner, I said!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.730
I swear, there's something wrong with Nishi!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.180
You said it!

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.190
The slums have gotten rowdy ever since Joe came back,

00:13:56.190 --> 00:14:00.320
but I don't get why Nishi-kun's the only one that doesn't look happy.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.330
I'm going to go check on him.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.960
Nishi-kun, your miso soup will get cold!

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:24.300
What's the matter, Nishi-kun?

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:32.180
Yabuki-kun finally came back yesterday, but you didn't even go see him.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.560
This isn't like you.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.850
Truth is, Noriko-han...

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:39.530
I got a favor to ask of you...

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.070
A favor? What is it?

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.160
Can you come with me to see Joe?

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.160
What are you talking about, Nishi-kun?

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.070
If you want to see Yabuki-kun, why do I...

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.540
I can't!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.540
I just can't face him on my own...

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.210
I understand. I'll go with you.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.210
Thanks.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.880
Okay, you're in, you're in!

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.840
Yeah, that's the way! Push! Push!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.220
There!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.850
And we have a winner!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.730
Next up, it's Tonkichi and Hyoromatsu!

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.520
You're in! You're in!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.730
Hey, old man...

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.570
Why don't you call Nishi back?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.740
It's a real shame!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.490
This gym is in better shape than ever,

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:34.540
but he won't get anywhere without a sparring partner.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.750
Don't talk about Nishi.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:40.000
Joe's gonna get fired up whether he likes it or not.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.550
And when he does, he can make it through on his own.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.470
You really think so?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.680
Good morning, Yabuki-kun!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.650
Hey!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.730
What are you doing here so early?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.600
I came to make you some good food!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.730
Wow, really? Awesome!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.480
Thanks a bunch!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.780
Nishi-kun!

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:07.740
It's Mammoth!

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.110
Oh yeah, you're right!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.540
What?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.910
What's Nishi doing over there?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.620
He said he wanted to talk to you.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:21.120
Talk to me?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.130
I think he wants to talk in private.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.130
Hey, what does he want to talk about?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.050
Don't ask me!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.680
This is between men!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.430
Now, you children go inside! I'll make some food!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.890
I'm borrowing your kitchen again!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.930
Thanks for all your help!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.270
What're you gonna make?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.230
No touching!

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:50.910
Hey there, Nishi!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.620
Joe, I'm sorry I didn't come and see you...

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.040
What're you talking about?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.670
It's not like I'm anybody important. You're only making me feel embarrassed.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.460
So why don't we talk outside?

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.670
It's a lovely day out here!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.670
Sure.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.390
Joe!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.140
Yeah?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.760
I bet you think I'm a cold guy, don't ya?

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:17.780
For what?

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:24.270
For not offering to be your sparring partner now that you're back.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.890
Oh, I don't think so at all.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:30.110
I heard that you left boxing,

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.400
and that you're working hard at Hayashi's.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.900
That's pretty neat.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:52.210
You helped me during the short time we boxed together.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.890
A boxer's got a short lifespan.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:56.850
We all retire sooner or later.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.430
Just focus on your second life now.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.850
I'm sorry, Joe.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.600
You've got nothing to apologize for.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.690
If you offered to lend that injured hand of yours, I'd turn it down.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.110
You knew?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.450
We've eaten at the same table.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.040
I can pick up on things like that.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.740
I fought an eight-round match three months ago.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:24.250
And by round seven, I almost had a chance to KO my opponent.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.540
But I got too eager.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.960
Man, was I stupid.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.260
I went for broke too early, only for him to knock me out, and I...

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.800
Don't mention it.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.470
I'll go on, with or without you.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.220
Joe!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:44.440
Call me whenever you need me!
I'll drop everything to spar with you!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.440
Forget it.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:53.900
Boxing's not something you can pick up again once you've retired.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.580
Joe... I'm so happy...

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.950
You're the real deal!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.420
The real Yabuki Joe...

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.200
What's the matter, kids?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.880
<i>We're sorry, Nishi!</i>

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:16.880
We didn't know about this, and then talked behind your back...

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.180
It's fine.

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.350
I was planning to tell you about it eventually.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:21.720
Nishi-kun!

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.810
M-Mister!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.850
And the Missus!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.940
Well, as much as I hate to say this,

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.820
I was worried that you'd choose to go back to the gym...

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:39.860
I'm sorry. I'm always causing you nothing but trouble.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.280
No, I should apologize for doubting you.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.370
Hope you can forgive me, too, Joe.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.540
What's to forgive?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.540
Nishi's one of your fine employees now!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.870
I hope you'll take good care of him.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.630
Of course, you can count on me!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.920
I've got a feeling you can't count on him.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.880
Say that again, you little...

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.880
I'd much rather count on her!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.510
What are you all doing over there?

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.720
Food's ready!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.560
All right! Hail to the chef!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.900
Why don't we all take that food and go out to the beach?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.020
That's it!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.780
Let's celebrate Nishi's retirement and Joe's comeback

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:17.440
with some sea bathing!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.160
I'll be providing the car,

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:27.450
so fill 'er up with canned food and juice and whatever you want to eat!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.210
See, now I can count on you!

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:30.450
Why you little...

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:47.510
Yeah! Let's play!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.020
It's yours!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:52.900
There!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.020
Go!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.870
Isn't it great that Nishi-kun got that off his chest?

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:07.580
Yeah. Now Joe can finally make his comeback without any worries.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.160
Oh, Joe!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.670
I never expected to see you here, Yabuki-kun.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.130
Are you here to train?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.130
Hey, I'm not that out of shape!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.090
I hope you're not being overconfident.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.100
You've got a real match with Carlos coming up.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:16.600
That's right. And I swear that I'll knock you out.

00:22:20.390 --> 00:22:21.610
I don't think you can say that, Señor.

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:27.620
We won't know that until we take it to the ring!

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:29.120
Hey, Joe!

00:22:29.790 --> 00:22:31.530
Well, best of luck anyway.

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:33.620
I look forward to our next meeting, Señor.

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.620
What are you doing over there? Get back here!

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:38.170
Okay, here I go!

00:24:38.620 --> 00:24:40.750
The Carlos-Harajima match has come.

00:24:40.750 --> 00:24:45.110
It seemed that Carlos was having a hard time against Harajima's one-sided attack.

00:24:45.110 --> 00:24:49.380
But Joe watches quietly, following Carlos' movements.

00:24:49.380 --> 00:24:51.670
Joe's eyes will not leave Carlos!

00:24:52.300 --> 00:24:55.090
And just as they planned, at the end of the fourth round,

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:58.350
Robert whistles the signal and Carlos' eyes light up,

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:00.520
as he unleashes his punch of terror!

00:25:00.520 --> 00:25:04.690
Now, as Carlos once again reveals his unfathomable power,

00:25:04.690 --> 00:25:06.950
and lights Joe's fighting spirit anew,

00:25:06.950 --> 00:25:08.780
which way is tomorrow!?
